# ROMs, patches, saves and dumps never belong in this repo.
# The *.txt glob is deliberately broad: it catches emulator traces, the
# two-language side-by-side file and the working table by default. Anything
# that genuinely belongs can be force-added later with `git add -f`.

*.sfc
*.smc
*.ips
*.bps
*.srm
*.txt
*.dmp
